	measure '_Revenue Variance rel. PY | Data Bar | Cut-off' = ```


		VAR __Relative_Variance     = [_Revenue Variance rel. PY]
		VAR __Cap_Threshold         = [_Cut-off Point | Relative Variance | Cut-off Threshold]
		VAR __Neg_Cap_Threshold     = __Cap_Threshold * (-1)

		VAR __Result = 
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            __Relative_Variance > __Cap_Threshold,     __Cap_Threshold,
		            __Relative_Variance < __Neg_Cap_Threshold, __Neg_Cap_Threshold,
		            __Relative_Variance
		    )
		            
		RETURN __Result

		```
		formatString: ;;;
		displayFolder: 02. Supplemental Calculations\02. Variances\06. Relative Var. PY | Cut-off Logic\02. Data Bars
		lineageTag: 9b9d63a0-63a4-4af7-9658-cd37517c4804

	measure '_Revenue Variance rel. PY | Data Bar | Cut-off | Values' = ```


		VAR __Relative_Variance     = [_Revenue Variance rel. PY]
		VAR __Cap_Threshold         = [_Cut-off Point | Relative Variance | Cut-off Threshold]
		VAR __Neg_Cap_Threshold     = __Cap_Threshold * (-1)

		VAR __Result = 
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            __Relative_Variance > __Cap_Threshold,     __Cap_Threshold,
		            __Relative_Variance < __Neg_Cap_Threshold, __Neg_Cap_Threshold,
		            __Relative_Variance
		    )
		            
