	measure '_Revenue Variance rel. PY | Icon Up/Down | Cut-off' = ```


		VAR __Relative_Variance     = [_Revenue Variance rel. PY]
		VAR __Cap_Threshold         = [_Cut-off Point | Relative Variance | Cut-off Threshold]
		VAR __Neg_Cap_Threshold     = __Cap_Threshold * (-1)

		VAR __Icon_Positive         = [_Icon | Double Arrow | Up | Green]
		VAR __Icon_Negative         = [_Icon | Double Arrow | Down | Red]

		VAR __Result = 
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            __Relative_Variance > __Cap_Threshold,     __Icon_Positive & "",  
		            __Relative_Variance < __Neg_Cap_Threshold, __Icon_Negative & "",
		            BLANK()
		    )
		            
		RETURN __Result
		```
		displayFolder: 02. Supplemental Calculations\02. Variances\06. Relative Var. PY | Cut-off Logic\03. Icons
		dataCategory: ImageUrl
		lineageTag: 8626d0d5-3d45-4459-8f17-ea8a8676eabb

