	measure '_Revenue Variance rel. Scenario' = ```


		VAR __AC_Value       = [_Revenue AC]
		VAR __Scenario_Value = [_Revenue Scenario]

		VAR __IsValid = 
		    NOT ISBLANK ( __AC_Value )       && 
		    NOT ISBLANK ( __Scenario_Value ) &&
		    __AC_Value       > 0             && 
		    __Scenario_Value > 0

		VAR __Result =
		    IF (
		        __IsValid,
		            DIVIDE ( 
		                __AC_Value - __Scenario_Value,
		                __Scenario_Value
		            )
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		```
		formatString: +0.0%;-0.0%;0%
		displayFolder: 02. Supplemental Calculations\02. Variances\03. Dynamic Scenario\01. Core
		lineageTag: 60ea4286-45b5-4abf-b95d-7640b8fa725e

