	measure '_Customer FX' = ```


		SWITCH (
		    TRUE(),
		    [_Customer Count | Lost] >=1, "#C27171",
		    [_Customer Count | New] >=1, "#4C80B7",
		    ISBLANK ([_Revenue AC] ), "#EDF1F4"
		)
		```
