	measure '_Revenue PY Suppression | Extended' = ```


		VAR __Scenario_Value    = [_Revenue PY | Equalized]
		VAR __Scenario_Name     = "PY" // -> Manual Input
		VAR __Is_Filtered       = ISCROSSFILTERED ( 'TBL Scenario Selection'[Name] )

		VAR __Is_Selected = 
		    NOT ISEMPTY ( 
		        FILTER ( 
		            'TBL Scenario Selection', 
		            'TBL Scenario Selection'[Name] IN { __Scenario_Name } ) 
		    )

		VAR __Result = 
		    IF (
		        __Is_Filtered && __Is_Selected,
		        __Scenario_Value
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		```
		displayFolder: 02. Supplemental Calculations\03. Suppresion (hiding metrics)
		lineageTag: 31fbe85f-704a-426e-a7ce-07b3654c3495

