	measure '_Last Date Non Blank Revenue' = ```


		VAR __Last_Period =
		    MAXX ( 
		        CALCULATETABLE (
		            FILTER ( 
		                ADDCOLUMNS (
		                    ALL ( 'Dim Calendar'[Date] ),
		                    "Value", [_Revenue AC]
		                ),
		                NOT ISBLANK ( [Value] )
		            ),
		            REMOVEFILTERS()
		        ),
		        'Dim Calendar'[Date]
		    )
		        
		RETURN __Last_Period
		```
